    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 557.12,
      "end": 558.06,
      "en": "They have the answers to everything.",
      "zh": "他们对一切都有答案。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 558.52,
      "end": 561.26,
      "en": "But they really, really try and show everyone that they know everything.",
      "zh": "但他们真的，真的试图向每个人表明他们知道一切。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 562.72,
      "end": 565.7,
      "en": "These people can be sometimes a little bit irritating, right?",
      "zh": "这些人有时会有点烦人，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 565.92,
      "end": 567.18,
      "en": "Yeah, very, very annoying.",
      "zh": "是的，非常非常烦人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 568.1,
      "end": 568.54,
      "en": "Annoying.",
      "zh": "烦人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 568.64,
      "end": 569.64,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 569.64,
      "end": 572.84,
      "en": "All right, so it's not a good thing to be a know it all all the time.",
      "zh": "好吧，所以一直都知道这不是一件好事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 573.08,
      "end": 577.08,
      "en": "Yeah, actually all of these phrases are not good things to be.",
      "zh": "是的，实际上所有这些短语都不是好东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 577.08,
      "end": 594.4,
      "en": "Okay, so let's listen to our dialogue one more time and then we're going to come back and Erica's going to tell us how much she hates math.",
      "zh": "好吧，让我们再听一次我们的对话，然后我们会回来，Erica 会告诉我们她有多讨厌数学。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 594.4,
      "end": 595.9,
      "en": "All right children, let's review.",
      "zh": "好吧，孩子们，让我们回顾一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 596.54,
      "end": 597.36,
      "en": "Tommy, pay attention.",
      "zh": "汤米，注意听。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 598.08,
      "end": 599.8,
      "en": "Sorry, Miss Catlett.",
      "zh": "对不起，卡特利特小姐。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 600.2,
      "end": 601.52,
      "en": "Okay, Crystal, now tell me.",
      "zh": "好，克丽丝特尔，你来回答。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 602.36,
      "end": 604.64,
      "en": "What's four plus eleven?",
      "zh": "四加十一是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 604.64,
      "end": 605.64,
      "en": "Fifteen.",
      "zh": "十五。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 606.64,
      "end": 608.06,
      "en": "Miss Catlett always asks Crystal.",
      "zh": "卡特利特小姐总是问水晶。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 608.6,
      "end": 609.35,
      "en": "She's such a teacher's pet.",
      "zh": "她就是老师的宠儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 610.3,
      "end": 613.37,
      "en": "Okay, and what about 56 minus 60?",
      "zh": "好的，56 减 60 呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 614.04,
      "end": 616.24,
      "en": "Negative four.",
      "zh": "负四。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 616.24,
      "end": 616.57,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 617.24,
      "end": 618.64,
      "en": "Twelve times twelve?",
      "zh": "十二乘十二？"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 618.64,
      "end": 619.77,
      "en": "Very good, suck up.",
      "zh": "非常好，吸起来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 620.64,
      "end": 621.64,
      "en": "144.",
      "zh": "一百四十四。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 622.04,
      "end": 623.54,
      "en": "Zero divided by one?",
      "zh": "零除以一？"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 624.28,
      "end": 625.44,
      "en": "Zero.",
      "zh": "零。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 625.44,
      "end": 626.42,
      "en": "How did you know that?",
      "zh": "你怎么知道的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 627.0,
      "end": 628.04,
      "en": "Okay, smarty pants.",
      "zh": "好啊，机灵鬼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 628.56,
      "end": 629.84,
      "en": "The square root of two.",
      "zh": "二的平方根。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 630.12,
      "end": 635.6,
      "en": "Bet you're not going to get that one, know it all.",
      "zh": "打赌你不会得到那一，知道这一切。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 635.6,
      "end": 636.6,
      "en": "1.4142135.",
      "zh": "一点四一四二一三五。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 641.96,
      "end": 646.16,
      "en": "All right, so Erica, you were telling me that you hated math or you still do.",
      "zh": "好吧，所以埃里卡，你告诉我你讨厌数学，或者你仍然喜欢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 646.72,
      "end": 648.24,
      "en": "Well, yes, that's true.",
      "zh": "嗯，是的，这是真的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 648.24,
      "end": 656.96,
      "en": "I really do hate math and even doing a simple, you know, like 16 plus 32 is too hard for me.",
      "zh": "我真的很讨厌数学，甚至做一个简单的，你知道，16加32对我来说太难了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 656.96,
      "end": 660.83,
      "en": "So you were never really that type of person that's good with numbers.",
      "zh": "所以你从来都不是那种擅长数字的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 661.13,
      "end": 662.17,
      "en": "No, I'm terrible with numbers.",
      "zh": "不，我对数字很糟糕。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 662.37,
      "end": 664.25,
      "en": "I can't even remember my own phone number.",
      "zh": "我什至不记得我自己的电话号码。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 664.45,
      "end": 664.63,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 665.56,
      "end": 666.56,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 666.56,
      "end": 672.17,
      "en": "Like I really, if someone asks me for my phone number, I have to look on my phone in the address book to find it.",
      "zh": "就像我真的一样，如果有人要我的电话号码，我必须在通讯簿中查看我的手机才能找到它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 672.95,
      "end": 674.73,
      "en": "Well, yeah, sometimes numbers can be difficult.",
      "zh": "嗯，是的，有时数字可能很困难。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 675.21,
      "end": 677.69,
      "en": "I kind of liked math when I was younger.",
      "zh": "我年轻的时候有点喜欢数学。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 677.93,
      "end": 679.55,
      "en": "It just made sense.",
      "zh": "它只是有道理的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 680.12,
      "end": 684.76,
      "en": "Well, I guess there's a reason why I'm an English teacher and not a math teacher.",
      "zh": "好吧，我想我是一名英语老师而不是数学老师是有原因的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 684.76,
      "end": 686.8,
      "en": "And I was actually not very good at language.",
      "zh": "而且我实际上不太擅长语言。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 687.76,
      "end": 688.16,
      "en": "But here you are.",
      "zh": "但你在这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 688.76,
      "end": 689.76,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 689.76,
      "end": 692.24,
      "en": "Well, I mean, in Spanish, I like grammar.",
      "zh": "嗯，我的意思是，在西班牙语中，我喜欢语法。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 692.24,
      "end": 693.38,
      "en": "Not very good at that, all those rules.",
      "zh": "不是很擅长，所有这些规则。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 693.82,
      "end": 694.7,
      "en": "Yeah, but you're pretty good at English.",
      "zh": "是的，但你的英语很擅长。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 695.08,
      "end": 695.86,
      "en": "Oh, that's all right.",
      "zh": "哦，没关系。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 696.08,
      "end": 697.08,
      "en": "That's all right.",
      "zh": "没关系。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 697.08,
      "end": 698.08,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 698.08,
      "end": 699.08,
      "en": "What about you guys?",
      "zh": "你们呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 699.08,
      "end": 703.12,
      "en": "Tell us what your favorite subject or your least favorite subject in school was.",
      "zh": "告诉我们您在学校最喜欢的科目或最不喜欢的科目是什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 703.12,
      "end": 703.36,
      "en": "What about you?",
      "zh": "你呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 704.12,
      "end": 706.88,
      "en": "Do you have any favorite subject or did you have a favorite subject?",
      "zh": "你有最喜欢的科目还是你有最喜欢的科目？"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 706.88,
      "end": 707.88,
      "en": "History.",
      "zh": "历史。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 707.88,
      "end": 708.88,
      "en": "History.",
      "zh": "历史。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 708.88,
      "end": 709.88,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 709.88,
      "end": 710.88,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 710.88,
      "end": 711.88,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 711.88,
      "end": 712.88,
      "en": "I liked chemistry for a while.",
      "zh": "我喜欢化学一段时间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 712.88,
      "end": 713.88,
      "en": "Oh, God.",
      "zh": "哦，天哪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 713.88,
      "end": 714.88,
      "en": "Chemistry involves numbers.",
      "zh": "化学涉及数字。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 714.88,
      "end": 716.5,
      "en": "Well, a little bit, but it was interesting as well.",
      "zh": "嗯，有点，但也很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 717.08,
      "end": 722.34,
      "en": "So come to the website, everyone, EnglishPod.com and you can find lots of other resources there.",
      "zh": "所以来这个网站，每个人，englishpod.com，你可以在那里找到很多其他资源。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 722.84,
      "end": 730.36,
      "en": "And also be sure to check out our activity stream where you can answer and ask very quick questions depending on your level.",
      "zh": "还请务必查看我们的活动流，您可以根据您的水平回答并提出非常快速的问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 730.36,
      "end": 735.04,
      "en": "So you can choose if you're an elementary student, then you would be talking to other elementaries.",
      "zh": "因此，您可以选择是否是小学生，那么您将与其他小学生交谈。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 735.04,
      "end": 736.04,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 736.04,
      "end": 739.1,
      "en": "Thanks for downloading this lesson and until next time, goodbye.",
      "zh": "感谢您下载本课程，直到下一次，再见。"
    }
  ],
